ecord refusal and previously established predecessor/reducer/enum behavior. Do not repeat unrelated closed audits without new evidence. Shared API caller boundary is accepted; do not shrink remaining assigned requirements.\nCheck final-source provenance and actual exits for new narrowing mutants and same-instrument applied survivor; NOT_APPLIED/compile failure are not behavioral kills. Corrected formatting evidence must use existing paths. Reuse trustworthy exact-source prior evidence with explicit bounds; run necessary new independent regressions. All CI is local. Never edit the active product candidate or integrate; attach task-scoped verdict and raw evidence, then route accept_cr or changes requested through the normal lifecycle.\n\n\n\n### TASK-260830-21gygk_rework-rev6.md\nAttached file: `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/resources/TASK-260830-21gygk/TASK-260830-21gygk_rework-rev6.md`\n\n- Byte count: `2183`\n- Content digest: `sha256:f366940896a06c99b9d895b6cc9df27d63619f290c91fdc65471b7b79a4d0449`\n- Access: read-only\n\n\n\n\n\n## Evidence and Safety\n\n- Add/update a task-scoped outcome named `TASK-260830-21gygk_*` before handoff:\n  `task-board m 'add_resource(TASK-260830-21gygk, name=TASK-260830-21gygk_results.md, content=\"...\", type=outcome, description=\"Handoff evidence\")'`\n- Gating, refusing, validating, authorizing, or attesting behavior ships with negative tests that fail when the gate admits what it must reject; prove the bound by narrowing it, not only by deleting it, and name the production call site. Shapes and incidents: `references/negative-evidence.md`.\n- An absence and a failure to read are different facts; report unknown instead of inferring a property from a proxy signal.\n- Stop-The-Line only for an evidence-backed external blocker or unresolved human-only product/platform/architecture/approval decision. Persist evidence, failed attempts, options/tradeoffs, recommendation, and exact input needed; otherwise re