{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000cb1d","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a08917-49c2-7bc0-a7b5-22c36c1af078"},"sequence":1001,"recorded_at":1780531400001997,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"727d1962-de67-4017-b172-583d47fe4c9d","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"727d1962-de67-4017-b172-583d47fe4c9d","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"727d1962-de67-4017-b172-583d47fe4c9d"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0891a-cb64-7570-88df-0eb211898eed"},"task_id":"01a0891a-cb64-7570-88df-0eb211898eed","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0891a-cb64-7570-88df-0eb211898eed","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 47-60\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-// validatedCheckpoint is one admitted Checkpoint Record: its canonical\n-// digest with the session and lease it was taken under, plus the host\n-// that created it. Section 5.4 binds lease_epoch/lease_id to the\n-// referenced winning lease, so a successor's checkpoint names its\n-// predecessor lease, and binds created_by_host_id to the current\n-// lease holder: the holder of the lease the checkpoint names.\n-type validatedCheckpoint struct {\n-\tDigest        string\n-\tSessionID     string\n-\tLeaseEpoch    uint64\n-\tLeaseID       string\n-\tCreatorHostID string\n-\tRaw           []byte\n-}\n+// validatedCheckpoint is one admitted Checkpoint Record: its canonical\n+// digest with the session and lease it was taken under, plus the host\n+// that created it. Section 5.4 binds lease_epoch/lease_id to the\n+// referenced winning lease, so a successor's checkpoint names its\n+// predecessor lease, and binds created_by_host_id to the current\n+// lease holder: the holder of the lease the checkpoint names. The\n+// persistence presence members carry which variant the record uses;\n+// the referenced Session Record selects which variant is valid\n+// (checkCheckpointPersistence), because canonical shape alone admits\n+// either variant.\n+type validatedCheckpoint struct {\n+\tDigest              string\n+\tSessionID           string\n+\tLeaseEpoch          uint64\n+\tLeaseID             string\n+\tCreatorHostID       string\n+\tHasProviderManifest bool\n+\tHasTaskBoardBundle  bool\n+\tRaw                 []byte\n+}\n","final_result":true}}}
