{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000cb21","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a08917-49c2-7bc0-a7b5-22c36c1af078"},"sequence":1003,"recorded_at":1780531400002001,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"727d1962-de67-4017-b172-583d47fe4c9d","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"727d1962-de67-4017-b172-583d47fe4c9d","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"727d1962-de67-4017-b172-583d47fe4c9d"},"call_id":"call_01a0891ac3d674d0b3116f854e6397ff","text":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 47-60\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-// validatedCheckpoint is one admitted Checkpoint Record: its canonical\n-// digest with the session and lease it was taken under, plus the host\n-// that created it. Section 5.4 binds lease_epoch/lease_id to the\n-// referenced winning lease, so a successor's checkpoint names its\n-// predecessor lease, and binds created_by_host_id to the current\n-// lease holder: the holder of the lease the checkpoint names.\n-type validatedCheckpoint struct {\n-\tDigest        string\n-\tSessionID     string\n-\tLeaseEpoch    uint64\n-\tLeaseID       string\n-\tCreatorHostID string\n-\tRaw           []byte\n-}\n+// validatedCheckpoint is one admitted Checkpoint Record: its canonical\n+// digest with the session and lease it was taken under, plus the host\n+// that created it. Section 5.4 binds lease_epoch/lease_id to the\n+// referenced winning lease, so a successor's checkpoint names its\n+// predecessor lease, and binds created_by_host_id to the current\n+// lease holder: the holder of the lease the checkpoint names. The\n+// persistence presence members carry which variant the record uses;\n+// the referenced Session Record selects which variant is valid\n+// (checkCheckpointPersistence), because canonical shape alone admits\n+// either variant.\n+type validatedCheckpoint struct {\n+\tDigest              string\n+\tSessionID           string\n+\tLeaseEpoch          uint64\n+\tLeaseID             string\n+\tCreatorHostID       string\n+\tHasProviderManifest bool\n+\tHasTaskBoardBundle  bool\n+\tRaw                 []byte\n+}\n","edit_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","path":"/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-3tq4ns/worktree/internal/sessquery/lease.go","added":20,"removed":14},"correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","outcome":"success"}}}
