{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d139","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a08917-49c2-7bc0-a7b5-22c36c1af078"},"sequence":1783,"recorded_at":1780531400003561,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"727d1962-de67-4017-b172-583d47fe4c9d","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"727d1962-de67-4017-b172-583d47fe4c9d","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"727d1962-de67-4017-b172-583d47fe4c9d"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0891d-0a9a-7763-b239-624d8a9c8b1b"},"task_id":"01a0891d-0a9a-7763-b239-624d8a9c8b1b","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0891d-0a9a-7763-b239-624d8a9c8b1b","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-40-1\",\n  \"command\": \"cat >> LOGBOOK.md <<'EOF'\\n\\n### TASK-260830-21gygk — rev6 rework: checkpoint persistence variant bound to Session kind, RUN-260910-rev6b\\n\\n- DEFECT FAMILY (repeat of CR5 canonical-identity family, new\\n  relationship): `parseCheckpointRecord` dropped the persistence\\n  members and no check bound them to the Session Record, so a\\n  swapped-variant checkpoint kept canonical identity, session,\\n  lease, epoch, and creator and was admitted by all four shared\\n  entries including old-plan revalidation (CR6 P1, reviewer\\n  `TestRev6CheckpointPersistenceMustMatchSession` red baseline\\n  recorded pre-fix in `.temp/TASK-260830-21gygk/rev6-failing-baseline.log`:\\n  both wrong-variant subtests admitted, both controls passed).\\n- FIX (shared admission path, `internal/sessquery/lease.go`):\\n  `validatedCheckpoint` carries `HasProviderManifest` /\\n  `HasTaskBoardBundle` parsed as nullable digests; new\\n  `checkCheckpointPersistence` enforces direct=>provider-only and\\n  task_board=>bundle-only for the winner (`checkWinnerCheckpoint`)\\n  and every necessary ancestor (`checkCheckpointBinding`), with the\\n  Session kind threaded from the winning-source projection through\\n  `winningLeaseFor(sessionID, sessionKind)` at all three production\\n  call sites (bindPlan, Revalidate, authorize). Mismatch refuses\\n  selector_observation_unavailable; unknown kind refuses\\n  invalid_config. Class-level gate: task-scoped clause-to-owner\\n  conformance matrix for all owned 5.3/5.4/14.7.2\\n  Session/Lease/Checkpoint relationships written before the fix\\n  (`.temp/TASK-260830-21gygk/conformance-matrix.md`, attached as\\n  board outcome); the only unguarded owned relationship was C4,\\n  now repaired. No owned relationship declared delegated without\\n  an input-carrying delegated API.\\n- TESTS: ported reviewer test kept as\\n  `TestRev6CheckpointPersistenceMustMatchSession` plus winner-path\\n  old-plan revalidation; added `TestRev6TaskBoardPersistenceControl`\\n  (task_board positive control + provider-variant refusal through\\n  all four entries incl. old-plan) and\\n  `TestRev6PersistenceMismatchIsObservationUnavailable` (class).\\n  Direct test callers of `winningLeaseFor` pass the projected kind.\\n- MUTANTS: repaired `N-chain-self` for the 3-value `checkLeaseChain`\\n  return (`return chain, parent, nil`, same narrow self-link); added\\n  narrowing `N-checkpoint-persistence` (admits exactly the idA\\n  direct-session wrong variant). All lease.go anchors count 1.\\n  Focused final-source run with applied C-harmless-comment SURVIVED\\n  control through the identical instrument; bytes restored.\\n- DOCS: README/TRACEABILITY succession rows + `Reader` doc now\\n  state the kind-selected persistence variant. Work left\\n  uncommitted in the Story worktree for board CR.\\nEOF\\necho APPENDED; go test ./... -count=1 2>&1 | tail -25\",\n  \"description\": \"Append logbook entry and run full test suite\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"APPENDED\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/canonicaljson\\t21.025s\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/catalog\\t2.088s\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/catalog/cmd/cataloggen\\t2.855s\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/cataloggen\\t3.156s\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/cigate\\t6.582s\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/cliresult\\t1.976s\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/config\\t3.325s\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/dirnode\\t1.277s\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/environ\\t3.568s\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/invcore\\t3.787s\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/localstore\\t29.046s\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/provhost\\t16.063s\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/provider\\t4.922s\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/scalar\\t5.170s\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/secconftest\\t5.465s\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/secprim\\t5.527s\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/sessadapter\\t5.248s\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/sessquery\\t23.004s\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/sessrepo\\t11.576s\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/sessstate\\t52.052s\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/specdoc\\t4.726s\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/specpin\\t4.922s\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/terminalbackend\\t5.232s\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/traceability\\t7.221s\\nok  \\tgithub.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/traceability/cmd/tracecheck\\t43.503s\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1940,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 485,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
